     - Authentication failure due to invalid tokens
     - Database errors during updates
     - Successful MD5 hash computation for file and PEM content
     - Handling missing or inaccessible files

### Asynchronous Processing
Consider leveraging libraries like ReactPHP or Amp for asynchronous processing in PHP. This will help improve response times under high load conditions by allowing non-blocking I/O operations, especially useful when handling multiple simultaneous requests.

